post-it: Can't open images
cause: Programs lost their .EXE
symptoms:
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
	Icons don't open
checks:
	no: Programs start
		shows: in C:\WINDOWS: NOTEPAD, WORDPAD, PBRUSH, CALC and others
software steps:
	Double-click My Computer, (C:), Windows
	Rename NOTEPAD, WORDPAD, PBRUSH and CALC to end in .EXE (right-click, Rename)
